BEHAVIOR find-byte

DESCRIPTION
  Index of the first occurrence of a byte value in the first len bytes of
  buffer, or -1 if absent (memchr semantics). The byte is matched unsigned.

CONTRACT
  INPUT buffer bytes 65536
  INPUT value int 8
  INPUT len int 8
  OUTPUT index int 8
  GUARANTEES pure no_alloc writes_output

HASH bbe1c049

IMPLEMENTATION
  target = LOAD value 8
  tu = AND target 255 8
  lenv = LOAD len 8
  i = 0

  LABEL loop
    atend = IGE i lenv 8
    BRANCH atend notfound check

  LABEL check
    bb = LOAD buffer 1 i
    bu = AND bb 255 8
    match = IEQ bu tu 8
    BRANCH match found nextb

  LABEL found
    STORE index i 8
    JUMP done

  LABEL nextb
    i = IADD i 1 8
    JUMP loop

  LABEL notfound
    STORE index -1 8

  LABEL done
END
